        "summary": "Freepik contributor portfolio",
        "description": "A contributor's assets (the same fields as search), by relevance or newest first, 50 per page, up to 50 pages. Pass `next_page` back as `page`; it is null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/freepik-author-assets",
